---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Mahindra Rivenza 4 BHK Flats | Baner Annex Mahalunge Pune - Signature Estates"
  description="Explore official 4 BHK luxury residences at Mahindra Rivenza by Mahindra Lifespaces at Baner Annex, Mahalunge, Pune. 1,438 to 1,465 sq.ft. RERA carpet area, 4 BHK show home open on site, starting ₹2.20 Cr*. MahaRERA PR1261012602102 & PM1261012602103."
  keywords="mahindra rivenza 4 bhk, mahindra rivenza 4 bhk price, mahindra rivenza 4 bhk floor plan, mahindra rivenza 4 bhk carpet area, mahindra rivenza show residence, 4 bhk flats in baner annex pune"
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/residences/4-bhk/"
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-charcoal-950 border-b border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/30 text-gold-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
        <span>4 BHK Show Residence Open On-Site</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-stone-100 max-w-4xl leading-tight">
        4 BHK Luxury Estates: <br />
        <span class="gold-gradient-text">Sky Deck Mansions at Mahindra Rivenza</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed">
        The pinnacle of West Pune luxury living across 2 typologies (Luxury B & Luxury A) offering 1,438 to 1,465 sq.ft. RERA carpet area (1,615 to 1,651 sq.ft. aggregate) with fully furnished show home live at the on-site sales gallery. Starting from ₹2.20 Cr*.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Specs Grid -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal-900 border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gold-400">1,438 - 1,465 sq.ft.</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">RERA Carpet Area Range</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-100">1,615 - 1,651 sq.ft.</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Aggregate Usable Area</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gold-400">From ₹2.20 Cr*</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Launch Starting Price</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-400">Show Home Live</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Visit On-Site Sales Gallery</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Blueprint & Highlights -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-charcoal-900 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">Official Architectural Blueprint</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gold-400 bg-gold-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-gold-500/30 font-semibold">Show Residence Open On-Site</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-2 sm:p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 700 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full h-auto text-stone-300 font-sans select-none">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="b4-bg-page" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0a0e17"/>
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#141a27"/>
              </linearGradient>
              <pattern id="b4-grid-page" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <path d="M 20 0 L 0 0 0 20" fill="none" stroke="rgba(212,175,102,0.08)" stroke-width="0.75"/>
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <rect width="700" height="480" rx="12" fill="url(#b4-bg-page)" stroke="#334155" stroke-width="2"/>
            <rect width="700" height="480" rx="12" fill="url(#b4-grid-page)"/>
            <polygon points="30,35 670,35 670,445 30,445" fill="#101520" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="2.5" opacity="0.95"/>
            <g transform="translate(30, 35)">
              <rect width="110" height="75" fill="#1a2233" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="55" y="38" fill="#f5d794" font-size="9.5" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">PRIVATE LIFT LOBBY</text>
              <text x="55" y="52" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">8'0" × 6'0"</text>
              <circle cx="55" cy="65" r="4" fill="#22c55e"/>
              <text x="65" y="68" fill="#86efac" font-size="7">Direct Access Card</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(140, 35)">
              <rect width="320" height="210" fill="#131924" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1.8"/>
              <text x="160" y="85" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="1">GRAND SALON &amp; BANQUET DINING</text>
              <text x="160" y="105" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">28'0" × 16'0" (Double-Height Volume)</text>
              <rect x="40" y="130" width="95" height="45" rx="4" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1"/>
              <text x="87" y="157" fill="#f5d794" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle">FORMAL DINING (8-Seat)</text>
              <rect x="160" y="130" width="135" height="55" rx="5" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1"/>
              <text x="227" y="162" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="8.5" text-anchor="middle">PRESIDENTIAL SECTIONAL</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(460, 35)">
              <rect width="210" height="110" fill="#1e2a3d" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2"/>
              <text x="105" y="55" fill="#7dd3fc" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="1">HORIZON SKY DECK</text>
              <text x="105" y="75" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">18'0" × 7'6" • 186 Sq.Ft. Outdoor Deck</text>
              <text x="105" y="92" fill="#d4af66" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">✦ Unobstructed Sahyadri Mountain Horizon</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(30, 110)">
              <rect width="110" height="135" fill="#151b27" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="55" y="155" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">ISLAND KITCHEN</text>
              <text x="55" y="170" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">14'0" × 9'6"</text>
              <rect x="30" y="185" width="50" height="25" rx="2" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#64748b"/>
              <text x="55" y="201" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="7" text-anchor="middle">CHEF ISLAND</text>
              <rect x="10" y="215" width="90" height="25" fill="#1b2333" stroke="#475569"/>
              <text x="55" y="231" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="7" text-anchor="middle">UTILITY &amp; MAID ALCOVE</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(460, 145)">
              <rect width="210" height="100" fill="#141a26" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="105" y="185" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">BEDROOM 04 / MEDIA LOUNGE</text>
              <text x="105" y="202" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">13'0" × 11'0"</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(30, 245)">
              <rect width="270" height="200" fill="#172030" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="2"/>
              <text x="135" y="295" fill="#f5d794" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">PRESIDENTIAL MASTER SUITE</text>
              <text x="135" y="312" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">17'0" × 14'0" • Corner Glazing Panoramic</text>
              <rect x="75" y="330" width="120" height="75" rx="4" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1.2"/>
              <text x="135" y="372" fill="#f5d794" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">GRAND KING BED</text>
              <rect x="165" y="255" width="95" height="50" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#64748b"/>
              <text x="212" y="280" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">DRESSING ALCOVE</text>
              <text x="212" y="294" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="7" text-anchor="middle">9'0" × 6'0"</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(300, 245)">
              <rect width="180" height="200" fill="#131924" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="90" y="295" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">EXECUTIVE SUITE 02</text>
              <text x="90" y="312" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">14'6" × 12'6"</text>
              <rect x="40" y="335" width="100" height="70" rx="3" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#64748b"/>
              <text x="90" y="375" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">KING BED</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(480, 245)">
              <rect width="190" height="100" fill="#141a26" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="95" y="295" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">GUEST SUITE 03</text>
              <text x="95" y="312" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">13'6" × 11'6"</text>
              <rect y="100" width="190" height="100" fill="#162235" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="95" y="365" fill="#7dd3fc" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">5-FIXTURE LUXURY SPA BATH</text>
              <text x="95" y="382" fill="#cbd5e1" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">Freestanding Tub • Rain Shower • Double Vanity</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(640, 65)">
              <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="16" fill="#111622" stroke="#d4af66" stroke-width="1.2"/>
              <polygon points="0,-12 3,0 0,-2 -3,0" fill="#d4af66"/>
              <polygon points="0,12 3,0 0,2 -3,0" fill="#64748b"/>
              <text x="0" y="-15" fill="#d4af66" font-size="8" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">N</text>
            </g>
            <g transform="translate(40, 460)">
              <text x="0" y="14" fill="#d4af66" font-size="9" font-weight="bold">✦ RERA CARPET: 1,438 – 1,465 SQ.FT. (AGGREGATE USABLE: 1,615 – 1,650 SQ.FT.)</text>
              <text x="440" y="14" fill="#22c55e" font-size="9" font-weight="bold">SHOW RESIDENCE READY ON-SITE</text>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-stone-100 font-bold">4 BHK Typologies Breakdown</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-lg border border-gold-500/30">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-bold text-gold-400">4 BHK Luxury B</span>
              <span class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Phase 1</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-stone-300 mt-1">1,438 sq.ft. RERA</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">1,615 sq.ft. Aggregate</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-lg border border-gold-500/30">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-bold text-gold-400">4 BHK Luxury A</span>
              <span class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-400 bg-gold-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Show Home</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-stone-300 mt-1">1,465 sq.ft. RERA</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-400">1,650 sq.ft. Aggregate</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/20 text-xs text-stone-200 flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span><strong>4 BHK Show Home Experience:</strong> Fully furnished 4 BHK model residence is open for private preview at the on-site sales gallery.</span>
        </div>

        <h4 class="font-serif text-lg text-stone-100 font-bold">Key Architectural Advantages</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-300">
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>Private elevator lobby with dedicated access card vestibule.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>28-foot living salon opening onto an unobstructed panoramic sky deck.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>Dual presidential suites with luxury five-fixture bathrooms and walk-in closets.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-gold-400">✦</span>
            <span>3-side open layout delivering uninterrupted 270° Sahyadri mountain vistas.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <button
            data-open-modal
            data-unit="4 BHK Luxury Show Residence"
            data-interest="Book 4 BHK Show Home Visit"
            class="btn-shimmer flex-1 py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-400 to-gold-500 text-charcoal-950 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:shadow-xl transition-all"
          >
            Schedule Show Home Visit
          </button>
          <button
            data-open-modal
            data-interest="4 BHK Floor Plan PDF"
            class="py-3 px-4 rounded-xl border border-white/20 hover:border-gold-400/60 bg-white/5 text-stone-200 hover:text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all"
          >
            Download 4 BHK Floor Plans PDF
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 13.46-Acre Master Layout Context -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-900 border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-2">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-400 font-bold">Township Layout</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">4 BHK Signature Towers in Master Layout</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300">
          Positioned on the highest vantage points across the 13.46-acre master development overlooking the valley and central river basin.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-charcoal-950 border border-white/10">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-xs text-stone-300">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400 text-sm">Highest Elevation Sky Suites</div>
            <p>4 BHK signature residences are placed on premium elevated floors commanding 270° uninterrupted valley panoramas and Sahyadri horizon sunrises.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400 text-sm">Ultra-Low Density Floor Plate</div>
            <p>Only 2 to 4 residences per core with dual high-speed elevators and dedicated service lift ensuring supreme exclusivity and minimal wait times.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1.5">
            <div class="font-bold text-gold-400 text-sm">Private Green Promenade Access</div>
            <p>Direct priority elevator access to the vehicle-free 9+ acre central greens, reflexology garden, and private clubhouse dining salon.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
